  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Vision International, Sarajevo, and Ekonomska Kreditna Institutcija apply for 671,858 DEM from Sida to provide minority families, who will have returned to Eastern Republika Srpska during 2001, with access to business advice, grants and credits in order to enable them to establish sustainable enterprises in their communities</narrative>
